{"id":"r-ref-1-chargeback-after-full-refund","text":"Buyer was refunded the full capture on 14 Oct, then opened an UNAUTHORISED chargeback for the same amount the next day.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"refunds":[{"id":"ref_1","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-1","amountMinor":12900,"status":"COMPLETED","atSec":1791000000}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-REF-1","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_REFUND"]},"ec":["EC-DSP-1"]}
{"id":"r-ref-1-refund-exceeds-dispute","text":"Three partial refunds on the capture add up to more than the amount now claimed, so the claim is already covered.","dispute":{"reason":"INCORRECT_AMOUNT","amountMinor":4000,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","refunds":[{"id":"ref_1","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-1","amountMinor":2500,"status":"COMPLETED","atSec":1791000000},{"id":"ref_2","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-2","amountMinor":2000,"status":"COMPLETED","atSec":1791100000}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-REF-1","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_REFUND"]},"ec":["EC-DSP-1"]}
{"id":"r-appeal-1-lost-with-new-tracking","text":"We lost the case, PayPal still offers the appeal link, and the carrier produced a delivery scan that arrived after the decision.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"previouslyLost":true,"appealLinkPresent":true,"newEvidenceSinceLoss":true,"defenseState":"CLOSED_LOST"},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"fulfilmentDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-APPEAL-1","posture":"APPEAL","evidenceTypes":["DETAILS_OF_PURCHASE","PROOF_OF_FULFILLMENT"]},"ec":["EC-DSP-6"]}
{"id":"r-appeal-1-not-lost-so-no-appeal","text":"New evidence exists but the case is still open, so an appeal is not available yet and the not-received rules decide instead.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","stage":"CHARGEBACK","status":"WAITING_FOR_SELLER_RESPONSE","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"newEvidenceSinceLoss":true,"appealLinkPresent":true},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","paypalTrackerId":"TRK-1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-2","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_FULFILLMENT","ONLINE_TRACKING_INFORMATION"]},"ec":["EC-DSP-6"],"_note":"Label corrected twice. First the data was wrong (tracking never registered with PayPal, so PROOF_OF_FULFILLMENT had no source and R-NO-EVIDENCE correctly removed the contest). Then the label was wrong once R-STAGE-INQUIRY was added: the stage is INQUIRY with status OPEN, so EC-DSP-3 says no filing window is open yet. The table changed, not the facts."}
{"id":"r-nochain-1-not-our-order","text":"A dispute arrived on a capture we have no row for, so there is no custom_id, no mandate and no chain to point at.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-NOCHAIN-1","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-9"]}
{"id":"r-nochain-1-small-unmapped-claim","text":"Unmapped dispute for a small amount, below the auto-accept limit the merchant configured, so nobody is woken up for it.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"autoAcceptThresholdMinor":2000},"chain":{},"capture":{"amountMinor":900},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-NOCHAIN-1","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-9"]}
{"id":"r-nochain-1-unverifiable-mandate","text":"A mandate row exists but nothing ever verified the chain, so we hold no proof the purchase was authorised.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":false,"verifyNowChainValid":false},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-CHAIN-BAD","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-9"]}
{"id":"r-chain-bad-signature-mismatch","text":"The chain exists and failed verification with a signature mismatch, so no contest can be built on it.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":false,"verifyNowChainValid":false,"verifyErrors":["L3 signature does not verify against the key bound in L2"]},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-CHAIN-BAD","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":[]}}
{"id":"r-inr-1-nothing-shipped","text":"The buyer says the parcel never arrived and there is no shipment row at all for the order.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-1","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]}}
{"id":"r-inr-1-shipment-without-tracking","text":"A shipment row exists for the line but was never given a tracking number, so there is no delivery record to file.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"","status":"NOT_SHIPPED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-1","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]}}
{"id":"r-inr-3-parcel-still-moving","text":"Tracking is registered with PayPal and the parcel is still in transit, so there is nothing to file yet.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","paypalTrackerId":"TRK-1","status":"SHIPPED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-3","posture":"MESSAGE_ONLY","evidenceTypes":[]}}
{"id":"r-inr-3-partial-shipment-in-transit","text":"Two parcels were split; one delivered and one still moving, so the honest answer is to message rather than file half the evidence.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"fulfilmentDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","paypalTrackerId":"TRK-1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},{"id":"shp_2","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD2","paypalTrackerId":"TRK-2","status":"SHIPPED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-ALPINE-07","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1},{"sku":"SKU-ALPINE-07","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-3","posture":"MESSAGE_ONLY","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-CAP-1"]}
{"id":"r-inr-2-tracking-delivered","text":"Tracking exists and PayPal's tracker says delivered, so the dispatch is on record and we can argue it.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","paypalTrackerId":"TRK-1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-INR-2","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_FULFILLMENT","ONLINE_TRACKING_INFORMATION"]}}
{"id":"r-snad-agent-wrong-size","text":"The user asked for size 10 and size 9 arrived. The read-back the user approved never mentioned a size, so our own agent misread it.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"preferences":{"size":"10"},"readback":"**What you are authorising**\nOnly at **Northwind Outfitters**\nSpend at most **$130.00** in total"},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"9"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-AGENT","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-AGT-2"]}
{"id":"r-snad-agent-wrong-colour","text":"The user asked for black and the blue pair arrived; the read-back said nothing about colour, so the substitution is ours.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"preferences":{"color":"black","size":"10"},"readback":"**What you are authorising**\nOnly at **Northwind Outfitters**"},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"10","color":"blue"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-AGENT","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-AGT-2"]}
{"id":"r-snad-agent-readback-showed-the-variant","text":"The agent bought size 10, the read-back the user approved explicitly showed size 10, and size 10 arrived. We contest.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"preferences":{"size":"9"},"readback":"**What you are authorising**\nWe read **size** \"10\" as a preference, not a limit.","corpus":{"qualityDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"10"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-OK","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["ITEM_DESCRIPTION","ORDER_DETAILS"]},"ec":["EC-BUY-1"]}
{"id":"r-snad-merch-shipped-different-sku","text":"The merchant signed one SKU and shipped another. Our packet would be evidence against our own customer, so we refund.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"qualityDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-COTTAGE-3","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-MERCH","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-MER-3"]}
{"id":"r-snad-merch-short-quantity","text":"The order line was for two units and the shipment carried one, so the merchant's own records disagree with what was sent.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"qualityDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":17800,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":2}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-MERCH","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-MER-3"]}
{"id":"r-snad-thin-only-a-box-photo","text":"The item matches the signed order but the only photo we hold is of a packed box. Offer a return instead of filing nothing.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"10"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-THIN","posture":"OFFER","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-BUY-1"]}
{"id":"r-snad-ok-full-quality-evidence","text":"The item matches, the mandate permits it, and we hold the specification sheet. Contesting is a case we can argue.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"qualityDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"10"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-SNAD-OK","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["ITEM_DESCRIPTION","ORDER_DETAILS"]},"ec":["EC-BUY-1"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-2-device-lost-before-signing","text":"The device was reported lost the day before the mandate was signed, so the chain proves only that a key on a lost device signed.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"iatSec":1790000000,"deviceStatus":"LOST","deviceLostAtSec":1789000000},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-2","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-BUY-3"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-3-no-webauthn-small","text":"The chain verifies but there was no passkey at signing, and the amount is under the weak-case limit the merchant set.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"weakUnauthorisedThresholdMinor":5000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":false},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-3","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-BUY-3"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-3-no-webauthn-large","text":"No passkey at signing and the amount is above any configured limit, so a person decides whether to fight a claim we cannot support.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":42000,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"weakUnauthorisedThresholdMinor":5000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":42000,"orderAmountMinor":42000,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-3","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-BUY-3"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-1-passkey-authorised","text":"Device-key signature with a passkey user-verification, and the L3 signed by the key bound inside that mandate. Judge Mode J3.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"iatSec":1790000000},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-1","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["DETAILS_OF_PURCHASE","ORDER_DETAILS"]},"ec":["EC-BUY-1"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-1-device-lost-after-signing","text":"The device was reported lost, but four days after the mandate was signed, so the signing itself is still attributable to the account holder.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"iatSec":1790000000,"deviceStatus":"LOST","deviceLostAtSec":1790400000},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-1","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["DETAILS_OF_PURCHASE","ORDER_DETAILS"]},"ec":["EC-BUY-3"]}
{"id":"r-unauth-1-verify-now-recovered","text":"Verification failed at capture time for a clock reason but passes now, so we do not treat the chain as broken.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":false,"verifyNowChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"iatSec":1790000000},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-UNAUTH-1","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["DETAILS_OF_PURCHASE","ORDER_DETAILS"]}}
{"id":"r-amt-1-capture-matches-order","text":"The buyer says the amount is wrong; captures total the signed order exactly, one capture per shipment, and we hold the receipt copy.","dispute":{"reason":"INCORRECT_AMOUNT","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"receiptCopy":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-AMT-1","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_RECEIPT_COPY"]},"ec":["EC-MER-2"]}
{"id":"r-amt-1-partial-refund-then-full-claim","text":"A partial refund left the balance disputed. The refund is smaller than the claim, so we contest the remainder with the receipt.","dispute":{"reason":"INCORRECT_AMOUNT","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"receiptCopy":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","refunds":[{"id":"ref_1","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-1","amountMinor":2000,"status":"COMPLETED","atSec":1791000000}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-AMT-1","posture":"CONTEST","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_RECEIPT_COPY"]},"ec":["EC-DSP-2"]}
{"id":"r-amt-2-duplicate-capture","text":"The same shipment was captured twice by a retry. We took the money twice for one delivery, so we correct it rather than defend it.","dispute":{"reason":"DUPLICATE_TRANSACTION","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":17800,"shipmentId":"shp_1","siblings":[{"id":"cap_b","amountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-AMT-2","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-MER-2"]}
{"id":"r-cnp-1-credit-not-processed","text":"The buyer says a credit never landed. We refunded part of it on 12 Oct and the refund id is the proof for that part.","dispute":{"reason":"CREDIT_NOT_PROCESSED","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200,"shipmentId":"shp_1","refunds":[{"id":"ref_1","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-9","amountMinor":2000,"status":"COMPLETED","atSec":1790800000}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-CNP-1","posture":"ACCEPT_CLAIM","evidenceTypes":["PROOF_OF_REFUND"]},"ec":["EC-REF-3"],"_note":"Label corrected once. A refund equal to the disputed amount is R-REF-1 (EC-DSP-1, chargeback after refund) and R-REF-1 is evaluated first by design. R-CNP-1 is reached when the refund covers only part of the claim, which is the situation the spec row describes."}
{"id":"r-cnp-1-pending-refund-is-not-proof","text":"The refund is still PENDING, so it does not yet prove anything. The claim is true on its face and a person decides.","dispute":{"reason":"CREDIT_NOT_PROCESSED","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200,"shipmentId":"shp_1","refunds":[{"id":"ref_1","paypalRefundId":"REFUND-9","amountMinor":4200,"status":"PENDING","atSec":1790800000}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-DEFAULT","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-REF-3"]}
{"id":"r-other-refund-paid-by-other-means","text":"The buyer says they never paid us by PayPal. The chain verifies and the capture matches, so there is no evidence that helps and we refund.","dispute":{"reason":"PAYMENT_BY_OTHER_MEANS","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-OTHER-REFUND","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"_note":"Covers R-OTHER-REFUND for the eval. The rule is tested predicate-by-predicate over all four of PayPal's unassigned reasons in test/rules.test.ts, and spec AT-M15.1 asks for two fixtures per rule in the table tests rather than in the 40-case set, which only has to cover every rule."}
{"id":"r-deadline-1-tracking-not-in-paypal","text":"We hold a tracking number we never registered with PayPal and no carrier document, the deadline is in 40 hours, so we settle rather than file nothing.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1791514400},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-DEADLINE-1","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-7"]}
{"id":"r-deadline-1-no-receipt-copy-24h","text":"An amount claim we would normally contest with the receipt copy, but we have no copy and there are 24 hours left. We settle.","dispute":{"reason":"INCORRECT_AMOUNT","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1791586400},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-DEADLINE-1","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-7"]}
{"id":"r-no-evidence-1-no-receipt-copy-large","text":"An amount claim whose receipt copy we do not have, well above the settle limit. Filing nothing is not an option a router may choose.","dispute":{"reason":"INCORRECT_AMOUNT","amountMinor":8900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":8900,"orderAmountMinor":8900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-NO-EVIDENCE","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]}}
{"id":"r-no-evidence-2-unregistered-tracking-small","text":"Tracking the merchant never gave PayPal, on a claim below the auto-accept limit. Settling is cheaper than filing an empty packet.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_RECEIVED","amountMinor":900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000,"autoAcceptThresholdMinor":2000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":900,"orderAmountMinor":900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-NO-EVIDENCE","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-MER-4"]}
{"id":"r-default-01-no-rule-matched","text":"A CREDIT_NOT_PROCESSED claim on a fully mapped order with no refund anywhere: nothing in the signed record answers it.","dispute":{"reason":"CREDIT_NOT_PROCESSED","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-DEFAULT","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]},"_note":"Label corrected once. The case omitted the order, which makes it R-NOCHAIN-1 (EC-DSP-9, a dispute that cannot be mapped) rather than R-DEFAULT. The order is added so R-DEFAULT is what is left to test: CREDIT_NOT_PROCESSED with no refund anywhere on a fully mapped order."}
{"id":"r-default-02-merchant-not-in-chain","text":"An OTHER claim on a payment with no mandate at all: the router will not guess, and neither should a model.","dispute":{"reason":"OTHER","amountMinor":4200,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1792500000},"chain":{"mandatePresent":false},"capture":{"amountMinor":4200,"orderAmountMinor":4200},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-NOCHAIN-1","posture":"REVIEW","evidenceTypes":[]},"_note":"Label corrected once. The case set a 100000-minor-unit auto-accept limit, so accepting a 4200 claim was the correct answer and the REVIEW label was the wrong one. The limit is removed so the case tests what its text says: no mandate, so a person decides."}
{"id":"r-deadline-1-unauthorised-no-order-details-12h","text":"An unauthorised claim we would normally contest with the order details, but we have no merchant-signed checkout lines and there are 12 hours left.","dispute":{"reason":"UNAUTHORISED","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":1791543200},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"iatSec":1790000000},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1"},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-DEADLINE-1","posture":"REFUND","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-7"],"_note":"Third deadline case, added so the downgrade is reachable from three different filing rules rather than two. R-UNAUTH-1 needs ORDER_DETAILS, which needs the merchant-signed checkout lines; with none and twelve hours left, the honest answer is to settle."}
{"id":"r-stage-inquiry-01-no-window-open","text":"A not-as-described case with every document in hand, but the dispute is still an inquiry and PayPal has not asked for a response, so we write to the buyer instead of filing into a closed window.","dispute":{"reason":"MERCHANDISE_OR_SERVICE_NOT_AS_DESCRIBED","stage":"INQUIRY","status":"OPEN","amountMinor":12900,"currency":"USD","nowSec":1791500000,"sellerResponseDueSec":null},"chain":{"mandatePresent":true,"verifyAtCaptureChainValid":true,"webauthnPresent":true,"corpus":{"qualityDocument":true}},"capture":{"amountMinor":12900,"orderAmountMinor":12900,"shipmentId":"shp_1","shipments":[{"id":"shp_1","carrier":"BlueDart","trackingNumber":"BD1","status":"DELIVERED","lines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}]}],"checkoutLines":[{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","qty":1}],"disputedItem":{"sku":"SKU-TRAIL-42","attributes":{"size":"10"}}},"expect":{"ruleId":"R-STAGE-INQUIRY","posture":"MESSAGE_ONLY","evidenceTypes":[]},"ec":["EC-DSP-3"],"_note":"EC-DSP-3's own case. The underlying rule is R-SNAD-OK and every document is available, so nothing but the stage stops the filing - which is the point: the stage outranks the reason, and there is no deadline at INQUIRY to catch us filing too early."}
